<title>USA: Santander names Morfin senior analyst.</title>
<headline>Santander names Morfin senior analyst.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment said on Tuesday Sandra Morfin had joined the company as a senior analyst covering the Mexican conglomerate and mining sectors.</p>
<p>Santander said in a statement that before joining the company Morfin worked for Caspian Securities in Mexico City. She was responsible for the steel and mining sectors.</p>
<p>Morfin is based in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
